        581.5885009765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Generative modeling principles",
      "bbox": [
        259.958984375,
        579.4168090820312,
        347.61279296875,
        585.6513671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ".",
      "bbox": [
        407.4469909667969,
        556.9999389648438,
        410.2165832519531,
        565.8467407226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "(1)",
      "bbox": [
        493.05560302734375,
        557.1593627929688,
        504.6719665527344,
        566.06591796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The predominant approach relies on the autoregressive modeling (ARM)—commonly referred to as",
      "bbox": [
        107.69100189208984,
        596.4603271484375,
        503.9964294433594,
        605.3668823242188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the “next-token prediction” paradigm—to define the model distribution:",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        607.369384765625,
        394.50433349609375,
        616.2759399414062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
